I Native 组织改造的实践和思考》https://t.co/r3plK48zuf 来自 Manus 很好的 AI Native 组织改造一手实践分享。\n\n基于我的理解提炼一下要点：\n\n【1】团队的工程基建，从对人友好，变成了向 AI 暴露接口","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2114928688194011162"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:53:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114928322564259973"],"id":"2114928322564259973","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2376,"like_count":4,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"NASA 用 Claude 给\"毅力号\"火星车规划路线\n\nAnthropic周一公开的IPO招股书里，把一个太空案例当成了Claude Code的代表作：NASA让Claude为火星车规划行驶路线。\n\n由于火星离地球太远，信号延迟大，火星车没法实时遥控，过去都是地面工程师先看照片、逐个标点规划好路线，再发给火星车自行驾驶。 https://t.co/upITlhYJfQ","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2114928322564259973"},{"author_id":"1669276256","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:51:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114928011569213603"],"id":"2114928011569213603","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":103,"impression_count":19299,"like_count":77,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":70,"retweet_count":4},"text":"优化了一下我的个人 Memory 和多 Agent 的协作体系\n\n目前是 Codex、Muse 和 Grokbot 一起协作，每个有各自的职能，Claude 没敢让他加入 https://t.co/PNjFSswT82","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2114928011569213603"},{"author_id":"1072109417200414720","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:47:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114926959088324860"],"id":"2114926959088324860","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":110642,"like_count":177,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":72,"retweet_count":2},"text":"GPT找资料还是不太行，网上其实已经有判决书的全文了，还是没找到。\n\nAI干活也偷懒，在那干活看起来在分析来分析去，就是不去认真找资料。","url":"https://x.com/wangzhian8848/status/2114926959088324860"},{"author_id":"452072245","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:46:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114926643173327086"],"id":"2114926643173327086","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":81,"impression_count":11325,"like_count":120,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":20},"text":"最近开始折腾具身智能模型了。\n\n成功让一个机械臂在厨房里打开炉灶，然后把摩卡壶放了上去。\n\n大家可能会想，玩这种模型，又要